WEBVTT

00:23:59.756 --> 00:24:01.396
And then in the last decade or so,

00:24:01.436 --> 00:24:03.556
that has been progressively
kind of scrapped,

00:24:03.556 --> 00:24:05.636
so we are even in a more
dangerous situation

00:24:05.676 --> 00:24:08.276
than we were let's say,
at the end of the last century.

00:24:08.316 --> 00:24:09.476
YNH: Completely, I mean,

00:24:09.516 --> 00:24:14.156
we are now reaping
the bad fruits of neglect

00:24:14.196 --> 00:24:16.676
that's been going on for several years,

00:24:16.716 --> 00:24:19.316
not just about nuclear
weapons, but in general,

00:24:19.316 --> 00:24:24.836
about international institutions
and global cooperation.

00:24:25.396 --> 00:24:31.076
We’ve built, in the late 20th century,